15:28:36 INFO     harness.decomposition_review — [decomposition_review] AC STORY-001.AC-4 rewritten:
    was: Timezone source resolution
    now: The API resolves the timezone from the request header and uses it to determine the current local date for birthday calculations.
15:28:36 INFO     harness.decomposition_review — [decomposition_review] AC STORY-001.AC-5 rewritten:
    was: Missing timezone fails safely
    now: The API returns a 400 response when the timezone header is missing.
